    "name": "National Ahwach Festival",
    "id": "national-ahwach-festival",
    "description": "National festival in Ouarzazate dedicated to ahwach, the collective sung dance of the High and Anti-Atlas performed by men and women in traditional tribal dress. Troupes from across southern Morocco gather to perform and pass the art on.",
